version: 2.0.0
description: >-
  The npm workspaces of the a-paradigm monorepo. Each package carries its own
  .purpose with its symbols; this file only maps the folders. Paradigm CLI and
  MCP: paradigm/, paradigm-mcp/, paradigm-vscode/, logger/, runtime/. Symbol and
  file cores: purpose/core, premise/core, portal/, probe/, university-core/ and
  the university/ content pack. Gnomon (the 8.0 kernel and Mac app): gnomon/,
  gnomon-contracts/, gnomon-gui/, gnomon-wrapper/, gnomon-helper/,
  gnomon-local/, gnomon-voice/, gnomon-mod-sdk/, gnomon-mods/ and the
  gnomon-darwin-arm64/ platform package. Warpline: warpline/ and
  warpline-action/. Sentinel: sentinel/, sentinel-rs/, sentinel-web/. Also
  conductor/ and the site/. Build order is in the root package.json
  (build:core, build:gnomon, build:packages, build:cli).
